WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,680
Received Hello

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:04,760
The little girl inside

3
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:10,150
Are you willing to come with me? Captain Han, you said I would come with me.

4
00:00:10,270 --> 00:00:11,350
I'll take you to live a good life

5
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:12,510
Meat every meal

6
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:13,670
what do you want

7
00:00:13,790 --> 00:00:14,950
I'm basically satisfied

8
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:16,560
The most important thing is

9
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:17,600
in my base

10
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:19,040
No one will look down on you

11
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:23,120
It's okay if you want to bring your brother with you, but you agreed to come to my place.

12
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:25,280
You both have to listen to my brother

13
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:26,480
let's go together

14
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:34,820
Sister, you go with her, I won’t go.

15
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:39,600
The Xinhong Base still needs my brother and he can’t leave.

16
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:41,320
Don’t worry, just follow Captain Han.

17
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:42,680
Take good care of yourself from now on
